      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "NLP -> outside",
      "items": [
        "Gateway GET /internal/effective-config?service=nlp: live limits, cached 60 s",
        "Gateway GET /internal/model-registry-credential?provider&tenantId: S3 keys (X-Internal-Service-Key)",
        "Text POST /api/v1/generate: prompt, provider, model, provider_overrides (fixed in TASK-1016)",
        "Redis pub/sub clears the config cache instantly; HuggingFace or S3 supplies weights on first use"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "How to read it",
      "items": [
        "The database picks the model; the gateway sends model_name and clinical_taxonomy; NLP only runs it",
        "Missing model, tenant or token fails closed: 503, 428 or 401",
        "Dashed lines are optional: NLP still runs without the gateway config or Redis"
      ]
    }
